{{!
    @template plagiarism_essayguard/student_trend

    This learner's score across their earlier assessed work in the same course.

    Drawn only when there are at least two real points. There is no placeholder series:
    the chart is an argument about a person and an invented point would be worse than no
    chart at all.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * width - SVG width in user units.
    * height - SVG height in user units.
    * polyline - "x,y x,y" for the earlier work.
    * prevx, prevy - Last earlier point, where the final segment starts.
    * lastx, lasty - The current activity's point.
    * rising - Whether the current score is higher than the previous one.
    * points - Array of {x, y, score, label, iscurrent}.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "width": 420, "height": 150,
        "polyline": "22,120 122,118 222,112",
        "prevx": 222, "prevy": 112, "lastx": 322, "lasty": 40, "rising": true,
        "points": [
            {"x": 22, "y": 120, "score": 12, "label": "Quiz 1", "iscurrent": false},
            {"x": 322, "y": 40, "score": 78, "label": "This activity", "iscurrent": true}
        ]
    }
}}
<h4 class="essayguard-trend-heading">{{#str}}trend_heading, plagiarism_essayguard{{/str}}</h4>
<div class="essayguard-trend">
    <svg class="essayguard-trend-svg" viewBox="0 0 {{width}} {{height}}"
        role="img" aria-labelledby="essayguard-trend-desc" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
        <desc id="essayguard-trend-desc">{{#str}}trend_heading, plagiarism_essayguard{{/str}}:
            {{#points}}{{label}} {{score}}. {{/points}}</desc>
        <line class="essayguard-trend-axis" x1="0" y1="{{height}}" x2="{{width}}" y2="{{height}}"/>
        <polyline class="essayguard-trend-line" points="{{polyline}}"/>
        <line class="essayguard-trend-final{{#rising}} essayguard-trend-final-rising{{/rising}}"
            x1="{{prevx}}" y1="{{prevy}}" x2="{{lastx}}" y2="{{lasty}}"/>
        {{#points}}
        <circle class="essayguard-trend-dot{{#iscurrent}} essayguard-trend-dot-current{{/iscurrent}}"
            cx="{{x}}" cy="{{y}}" r="4"/>
        {{/points}}
    </svg>
    <ol class="essayguard-trend-labels">
        {{#points}}
        <li class="essayguard-trend-label{{#iscurrent}} essayguard-trend-label-current{{/iscurrent}}">
            <span class="essayguard-trend-label-name">{{label}}</span>
            <span class="essayguard-trend-label-score">{{score}}</span>
        </li>
        {{/points}}
    </ol>
</div>
